ScoreMaster OMR

This service runs copisteria and the copista-2m weights by KobiMusic, both licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). They are used unmodified, at the commit and revision
pinned in omr/Dockerfile:

- copisteria: https://github.com/kobimusic/copisteria
- copista-2m: https://huggingface.co/kobimusic/copista-2m

Their own LICENSE and NOTICE files are kept in /opt/copisteria and in the model repository.

The code in omr/ (app.py, merge.py) is part of ScoreMaster, licensed under the MIT License (LICENSE at the
repository root).
